w: The wind is whis-tling through the trees, the wind is blow-ing down the leaves and they fall, fall, fall, _ and they fall, fall, fall. _ The wind is play-ing a friend-ly game, the wind is whis-per-ing my name, as it calls, calls, calls, _ as it calls, calls, calls. _
